ipiscing elit. Aliquam fringilla commodo pretium. Pellentesque condimentum luctus ultricies. Nunc in ligula at est iaculis molestie nec vel metus. Phasellus hendrerit tristique tincidunt. Donec gravida varius tortor, in imperdiet sapien congue non. Sed sollicitudin, elit ac maximus maximus, ante tellus auctor est, a feugiat dolor ex ut lorem. Mauris porttitor efficitur felis, vitae eleifend risus ultrices eu. In semper nibh malesuada, imperdiet justo sed, dapibus quam.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2014-11-06 00:00:02','2026-01-12 20:46:33'),(7,'Track order','track-order','[woocommerce_order_tracking]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2014-11-12 14:41:47','2026-01-12 20:46:33'),(8,'FAQs','faqs','<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><strong>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</strong></p><p>Welcome to the Guerra Sports FAQ page! Here you’ll find answers to commonly asked questions about our products, shipping, returns, and more.</p> <p><strong>1. Ordering and Payment</strong></p><p><strong>Q: How do I place an order?</strong></p><p>A: Browse our website, add your desired items to the cart, and proceed to checkout. Follow the prompts to complete your order.</p><p><strong>Q: What payment methods do you accept?</strong></p><p>A: We accept major credit/debit cards.</p><p><strong>Q: Can I change or cancel my order after placing it?</strong></p><p>A: If your order hasn’t been shipped, you can request changes or cancellation by contacting our customer service team at <a>support@guerrasports.com</a>.</p> <p><strong>2. Shipping and Delivery</strong></p><p><strong>Q: Where do you ship to?</strong></p><p>A: We ship to locations worldwide. Check our shipping page for details on specific regions.</p><p><strong>Q: How long does delivery take?</strong></p><p>A: Delivery times vary by location and shipping method selected. Estimated times are provided at checkout.</p><p><strong>Q: How much does shipping cost?</strong></p><p>A: Shipping costs depend on your location and the size/weight of your order. The total cost will be calculated at checkout.</p><p><strong>Q: Can I track my order?</strong></p><p>A: Yes, once your order is shipped, we will send you a tracking number via email to monitor your delivery status.</p> <p><strong>3. Returns and Refunds</strong></p><p><strong>Q: What is your return policy?</strong></p><p>A: We accept returns within 14 days of receipt, provided the items are unused, undamaged, and in their original packaging.</p><p><strong>Q: How do I initiate a return?</strong></p><p>A: Contact our customer service team at <a>support@guerrasports.com</a> to receive return instructions and authorization.</p><p><strong>Q: How long does it take to process a refund?</strong></p><p>A: Refunds are processed within 7-10 business days after we receive the returned item.</p> <strong>4. Products and Availability</strong><p><strong>Q: Are your products available in different sizes?</strong></p><p>A: Yes, most of our sportswear and gear come in a range of sizes. Size guides are available on product pages to help you choose the right fit.</p><p><strong>Q: What if an item I want is out of stock?</strong></p><p>A: Out-of-stock items are restocked regularly. You can sign up for restock notifications on the product page.</p> <p><strong>5. Account and Support</strong></p><p><strong>Q: Do I need to create an account to shop?</strong></p><p>A: No, you can checkout as a guest. However, creating an account allows you to track orders, save shipping details, and enjoy a faster checkout process.</p><p><strong>Q: How can I contact customer support?</strong></p><p>A: You can reach us via email at <a>support@guerrasports.com</a> or through the contact form on our website.</p> <p><strong>6. Miscellaneous</strong></p><p><strong>Q: Is my personal information secure?</strong></p><p>A: Yes, we prioritize your privacy and use industry-standard security measures to protect your data. For details, please refer to our <a>Privacy Statement</a>.</p> <p>If your question wasn’t answered here, feel free to reach out to us at <a>support@guerrasports.com</a>. We’re happy to help!</p><p> </p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2014-12-15 07:00:36','2026-01-12 20:46:33'),(9,'Blog Masonry','blog-masonry','<article>\n															<a href=\"https://guerrasports.com/challenge-winners-reveal-their-secrets-to-success/\">\n									<figure>\n									<img width=\"800\" height=\"533\" src=\"https://guerrasports.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/6.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://guerrasports.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/6.jpg 800w, https://guerrasports.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/6-320x213.jpg 320w, https://guerrasports.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/6-768x512.jpg 768w, https://guerrasports.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/6-600x400.jpg 600w, https://guerrasports.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/6-500x333.jpg 500w, https://guerrasports.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/6-620x413.jpg 620w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />									</figure>\n								</a>\n							<header>\n									<!-- Blog Author -->\n										By\n										<a href=\"https://guerrasports.com/author/admin/\" title=\"Posts by John\" rel=\"author\">John</a>									\n									<!-- Blog Date Time -->\n										March 1, 2021									\n									<!-- Blog Comment -->\n										0									\n																<h4>\n									<a href=\"https://guerrasports.com/challenge-winners-reveal-their-secrets-to-success/\">Challenge Winners Reveal Their Secrets to Success</a>\n								</h4>\n							</header>\n														The extensive social distancing policies put in place to limit the spread of COVID-19 mean most people will have to\n								<!-- Blog Categories -->\n									Categories:\n									<a href=\"https://guerrasports.com/category/blog-sport/blog-cycling/\" rel=\"category tag\">Cycling</a>								\n								<!-- Blog Read More Button -->\n																<a href=\"https://guerrasports.com/challenge-winne