02.7 2.6-132.1-9c-19.6-7.8-34.7-22.9-42.6-42.6-11.7-29.5-9-99.5-9-132.1s-2.6-102.7 9-132.1c7.8-19.6 22.9-34.7 42.6-42.6 29.5-11.7 99.5-9 132.1-9s102.7-2.6 132.1 9c19.6 7.8 34.7 22.9 42.6 42.6 11.7 29.5 9 99.5 9 132.1s2.7 102.7-9 132.1z\"></path></svg>					</a>\n					<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@GuerraSports\" target=\"_blank\">\n						Youtube\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M549.655 124.083c-6.281-23.65-24.787-42.276-48.284-48.597C458.781 64 288 64 288 64S117.22 64 74.629 75.486c-23.497 6.322-42.003 24.947-48.284 48.597-11.412 42.867-11.412 132.305-11.412 132.305s0 89.438 11.412 132.305c6.281 23.65 24.787 41.5 48.284 47.821C117.22 448 288 448 288 448s170.78 0 213.371-11.486c23.497-6.321 42.003-24.171 48.284-47.821 11.412-42.867 11.412-132.305 11.412-132.305s0-89.438-11.412-132.305zm-317.51 213.508V175.185l142.739 81.205-142.739 81.201z\"></path></svg>					</a>\n					<figure><img width=\"104\" height=\"104\" src=\"https://guerrasports.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/feature-1.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Shop Online 24/7</h3><p>Shop with your smartphone</p>				\n					<figure><img width=\"104\" height=\"104\" src=\"https://guerrasports.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/check_1.webp\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Quality Products</h3><p>Fit for Champions</p>				\n					<figure><img width=\"104\" height=\"104\" src=\"https://guerrasports.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/feature-3.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Worldwide Shipping</h3><p>All over the world</p>				\n					<figure><img width=\"104\" height=\"104\" src=\"https://guerrasports.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/feature-4.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Secure Shopping</h3><p>You\'re in safe hands</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2022-05-05 13:12:41','2026-01-12 20:46:33'),(18,'Privacy Policy','privacy-policy','<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Your Privacy Matters</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This privacy statement explains how Guerra Sports collects, uses, and protects any information you provide when using <a>https://guerrasports.com</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>1. Information We Collect</strong> 1.1. We may collect personal information, such as your name, email, shipping address, phone number, and payment details, when you place an order or register an account. 1.2. Non-personal information, such as browser type, device information, and IP address, may be collected for analytical purposes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>2. How We Use Your Information</strong> 2.1. To process and fulfill your orders, including shipping and payment. 2.2. To improve our website and customer experience through analytics and feedback. 2.3. To send promotional emails, if you have opted to receive them. You can unsubscribe at any time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>3. Sharing Your Information</strong> 3.1. We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. 3.2. Information may be shared with third-party service providers for payment processing, order fulfillment, and marketing services, under strict confidentiality agreements. 3.3. We may disclose your information to comply with legal obligations or enforce our terms and conditions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>4. Data Security</strong> 4.1. We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your data. 4.2. While we strive to ensure the security of your information, no method of online transmission is entirely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute protection.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>5. Your Rights</strong> 5.1. You have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal information by contacting us. 5.2. You may opt out of marketing communications at any time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>6. Cookies</strong> 6.1. Our website uses cookies to enhance user experience. Cookies are small files stored on your device to help us analyze website traffic and tailor content. 6.2. You can disable cookies through your browser settings, but doing so may limit functionality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>7. Changes to This Policy</strong> 7.1. We may update this privacy statement periodically. Changes will be posted on this page.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Contact Us</strong> If you have any questions about our terms, conditions, or privacy practices, please contact us at <a>support@guerrasports.com</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2024-11-25 19:31:21','2026-01-12 20:46:33'),(20,'About us','about-us','		\r\n		<p>Guerra is a dynamic and fast-growing international sports brand dedicated to the world of Martial Arts and athleisure wear. With years of hands-on experience and deep industry knowledge, we design and manufacture premium equipment, apparel, and lifestyle pieces trusted by athletes around the globe.</p><p>At Guerra, we understand the demands of both performance and everyday movement—because we live it. Our products are crafted by athletes for athletes, built to deliver unmatched comfort, technical precision, and long-lasting durability, all with a sleek, modern aesthetic. Whether you\'re training, competing, or recovering in style, Guerra gear is made to perform, on and off the mat.</p><p><strong>Guerra</strong> - <em>Fit for Champions</em></p><h3>&nbsp;</h3>		\r\n					<h2>\"Our love for the sport drives who we are and what we do.\"</h2>				\r\n															',NULL,'/pages/about-us/about-us-default.webp',NULL,'','','published',NULL,NULL,NULL,1000,'2024-12-18 22:17:20','2026-01-24 17:42:22'),(21,'Our Vision','our-vision','		<p>At Guerra Sports, our vision is to become the leading, top of mind sports brand—trusted by athletes, admired by enthusiasts, and respected across the sports industry. We aim to lead with innovation, authenticity, and a deep commitment to performance and style.</p><p>Our growth is rooted in strategic expansion into key international markets, where we not only deliver high-quality, purpose-driven apparel but also foster meaningful connections. By providing sponsorship opportunities and championing athletes at every level, we empower a worldwide community of warriors—united by discipline, passion, and the relentless pursuit of greatness.</p>		\r\n					<h2>\"Reliable in training and during crunch time\"</h2>				\r\n',NULL,'/pages/our-vision/our-vision-default.webp',NULL,'','','published',NULL,NULL,NULL,1000,'2024-12-18 22:20:01','2026-01-24 18:28:26'),(22,'Sponsorship','sponsorship','		<p>At GUERRA Sports, we believe in showing up where it truly counts—supporting athletes when performance matters most. Our sponsorships go beyond logos and branding; they’re about standing beside athletes in critical moments, ensuring they have the comfort, durability, and confidence to deliver their best.</p><p>Every event we support is an opportunity to showcase our commitment. That’s why our gear isn’t off-the-shelf—it’s custom-designed for each competition, blending functionality with signature GUERRA style. Wherever we go, we bring distinction, performance, and purpose.</p><p>We show up where it matters most.<br>Reliable in training. Relentless in competition.<br>Tailored designs for every sponsored event.</p>		\r\n					<h2><br></h2><div><br></div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">Sponsorship for Athlete</h3><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"/pages/sponsorship/Sponsorship-Form-athlete-1769272374058-874942736.pdf\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" target=\"_blank\">Click here to download form</a></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">Sponsorship for Event</h3><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/pages/sponsorship/Sponsorship-Form-Event-1769272403145-505505847.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Click here to download form</a></div>		\r\n															\r\n<h2><br></h2><h2>\"Where Champions Find Their Edge.\"</h2>',NULL,'/pages/sponsorship/sponsorship-default.webp',NULL,'','','published',NULL,NULL,NULL,1000,'2024-12-18 22:22:20','2026-01-24 18:37:05'),(23,'Celebrities','celebrities','\r\n		<p><strong>Trusted by Champions. Worn by Icons.</strong></p><p>At GUERRA Sports, we don’t just meet expectations—we exceed them. We’ve pushed the boundaries of innovation, performance, and design to become a globally recognized brand in the martial arts world.</p><p>Our gear has earned its place among elite athletes and top-tier martial arts celebrities, cementing GUERRA’s reputation as a brand that stands for excellence, ambition, and authenticity.</p><p>From training mats to global stages—GUERRA is making its mark worldwide.</p>		\r\n					<h2>\"We are present where it matters the most.\"</h2>				\r\n															',NULL,'/pages/celebrities/celebrities-default.jpg',NULL,'','','published',NULL,NULL,NULL,1000,'2024-12-18 22:27:52','2026-01-24 18:39:24'),(24,'Franchise','franchise','		\r\n		<p><strong>Join the GUERRA Sports Family</strong><br>As a growing global brand, our mission is to expand GUERRA Sports into new markets while building a strong, united network of passionate partners. We are actively seeking dedicated individuals and businesses who share our vision and want to be part of our journey to become the worldwide leader in martial arts and athleisure wear.</p><p><strong>Why Choose GUERRA Sports?</strong><br>Created by athletes, for athletes, GUERRA Sports is committed to delivering premium design, unmatched comfort, and championship-quality gear. As a franchise partner, you benefit from our proven business model, trusted brand identity, and a comprehensive support system that sets you up for long-term success.</p><p><strong>We don’t just offer a franchise—we offer a partnership rooted in performance, trust, and shared ambition.</strong></p><p><strong>Franchise Benefits:</strong><br>Exclusive rights to develop and grow the brand in your home country<br>Full onboarding and operational training for you and your management team<br>Access to a confidential, detailed operations manual<br>Assistance in sourcing and stocking official GUERRA merchandise<br>Ongoing support from our corporate marketing and operations team<br>Access to our premium, custom-designed product line—built for comfort, durability, and standout style<br>And so much more...</p><p><strong>Comprehensive Support</strong><br>Our dedicated franchise support team is always ready to assist you. From training and knowledge transfer to daily operational guidance, we’re with you every step of the way—ensuring your success and helping you operate at full capacity from day one.</p><p><strong>Ready to Join the Fight?</strong><br>Become part of a powerful global movement. Become part of the GUERRA Sports family.</p><p><strong>Franchise Inquiries: </strong><a href=\"mailto:info@guerrasports.com\">info@guerrasports.com</a><br><strong>Call Us:</strong> <a href=\"tel:+96171807184\">+96171807184</a><br><strong>Instagram:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/guerra.sports\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">@guerra.sports</a></p>		\r\n					<h2>\"Built for Fighters, Designed for Victory.\"</h2>				\r\n															',NULL,'/pages/franchise/franchise-default.webp',NULL,'','','published',NULL,NULL,NULL,1000,'2024-12-18 22:32:41','2026-01-24 18:42:01'),(25,'Contact us','contact-us','\r\n		<p>GUERRA SPORTS&nbsp;</p><p>Part of Skyline Group LLC</p><p>Mobile / WA: +961 71 80 71 84</p><h4 style=\"margin-bottom: 0;\">DO YOU HAVE ANY QUESTION ?</h4><p>We are at your disposal 7 days a week!</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'','','published',NULL,NULL,NULL,1000,'2024-12-21 12:55:59','2026-01-26 15:51:33'),(26,'Refund and Returns Policy','refund_returns','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0px;\">Overview</span></p>\r\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>Our refund and returns policy lasts 14 days. If 14 days have passed since your purchase, we can’t offer you a full refund or exchange.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>To be eligible for a return, your item must be unused and in the same condition that you received it. It must also be in the original packaging.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>To complete your return, we require a receipt or proof of purchase.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p></p><h2>Refunds</h2><p></p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>Once your return is received and inspected, we will send you an email to notify you that we have received your returned item. We will also notify you of the approval or rejection of your refund.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>If you are approved, then your refund will be processed, and a credit will automatically be applied to your credit card or original method of payment, within a certain amount of days.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:heading -->\r\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Late or missing refunds</h3>\r\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>If you haven’t received a refund yet, first check your bank account again.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>Then contact your credit card company, it may take some time before your refund is officially posted.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>Next contact your bank. There is often some processing time before a refund is posted.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>If you’ve done all of this and you still have not received your refund yet, please contact us at info@guerrasports.com.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:heading -->\r\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Sale items</h3>\r\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>Only regular priced items may be refunded. Sale items cannot be refunded.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p></p><h2>Exchanges</h2><p></p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>We only replace items if they are defective or damaged. If you need to exchange it for the same item, send us an email at info@guerrasports.com we will email you the address where to return the products.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p></p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p></p><h2>Shipping returns</h2><p></p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>To return your product, send us an email, and we will email you back the address to return your goods.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>You will be responsible for paying for your own shipping costs for returning your item. Shipping costs are non-refundable. If you receive a refund, the cost of return shipping will be deducted from your refund.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>Depending on where you live, the time it may take for your exchanged product to reach you may vary.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>If you are returning more expensive items, you may consider using a trackable shipping service or purchasing shipping insurance. We don’t guarantee that we will receive your returned item.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p></p><h2>Need help?</h2><p></p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p><a href=\"/contact-us/\">Contact us</a> at for questions related to refunds and returns.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\r\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\r\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->',NULL,NULL,NULL,'','','published',NULL,NULL,NULL,1000,'2024-12-27 16:12:03','2026-01-24 19:01:46'),(27,'Gallery','gallery','<a data-id=\"20401\" href=\"https://guerrasports.com/central-american-mma-championship/\" target=\"_self\">                        <img src=\"https://guerrasports.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/central-American-Championship-7-768x768.jpg\"\n                             width=\"768\"\n                             height=\"768\"\n                             alt=\"Central American MMA Championship\">\n		</a>\n			<h3><a data-id=\"20401\" href=\"https://guerrasports.com/central-american-mma-championship/\" target=\"_self\">Central American MMA Championship</a></h3>\n				<a href=\"https://guerrasports.com/category/blog-gallery/\">Gallery</a>,<a href=\"https://guerrasports.com/category/mma/\">MMA</a>\n					<a data-id=\"20401\" href=\"https://guerrasports.com/central-american-mma-championship/\" target=\"_self\">Read More</a>                \n					<a data-id=\"20367\" href=\"https://guerrasports.com/youth-mma-events-sponsored-by-guerra-sports/\" target=\"_self\">                        <img src=\"https://guerrasports.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/1000412459-768x512.webp\"\n                             width=\"768\"\n                             height=\"512\"\n                             alt=\"Youth MMA events sponsored by Guerra sports\">\n		</a>\n			<h3><a data-id=\"20367\" href=\"https://guerrasports.com/youth-mma-events-sponsored-by-guerra-sports/\" target=\"_self\">Youth MMA events sponsored by Guerra sports</a></h3>\n				<a href=\"https://guerrasports.com/category/blog-gallery/\">Gallery</a>,<a href=\"https://guerra