d-sponsorship-form','[contact-form-7 id=\"5f43f09\" title=\"upload\"]<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1></h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'published',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-01-18 09:50:51','2026-01-12 20:46:33'),(30,'Terms & Conditions','terms-conditions','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p><strong>Welcome to Guerra Sports!</strong></p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>These terms and conditions outline the rules and regulations for the use of Guerra Sports’ website, located at <a>https://guerrasports.com</a>. By accessing this website, we assume you accept these terms and conditions in full. Do not continue to use Guerra Sports if you do not accept all the terms and conditions stated on this page.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p></p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p><strong>1. General Terms</strong> 1.1. By placing an order through our website, you agree to be bound by these terms. 1.2. You must be at least 18 years old to use our services or have parental consent to do so. 1.3. All products are subject to availability, and we reserve the right to limit the quantity of items sold or refuse service to any individual at our discretion.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p><strong>2. Orders and Payments</strong> 2.1. Orders are processed once payment is received. Accepted payment methods are listed on the website. 2.2. We strive for accurate pricing, but errors may occur. If an error in pricing is identified, we will inform you and allow you to either reconfirm or cancel the order. 2.3. All prices include applicable taxes unless otherwise stated.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p><strong>3. Shipping and Delivery</strong> 3.1. We ship to locations listed on our shipping page. Delivery times are estimates and may vary. 3.2. The customer is responsible for providing accurate shipping details. We are not liable for items lost due to incorrect addresses. 3.3. International shipments may incur customs duties or taxes, which are the customer’s responsibility.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p><strong>4. Returns and Refunds</strong> 4.1. Products can be returned within 14 days of receipt, provided they are unused, undamaged, and in original packaging. 4.2. To initiate a return, contact our customer service team for instructions. 4.3. Refunds will be processed to the original payment method within 7-10 business days of receiving the returned item.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p><strong>5. Intellectual Property</strong> 5.1. All content on this website, including text, images, logos, and designs, is the property of Guerra Sports unless otherwise credited. 5.2. Unauthorized use or reproduction of website content is prohibited.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p><strong>6. Limitation of Liability</strong> 6.1. Guerra Sports is not liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the use of our website or products. 6.2. Our liability for any claim is limited to the amount paid for the product purchased.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p><strong>7. Modifications to Terms</strong> 7.1. Guerra Sports reserves the right to update or modify these terms at any time without prior notice. Changes will be effective upon posting to the website.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\r\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\r\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p></p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p></p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->',NULL,NULL,NULL,'','','published',NULL,NULL,NULL,1000,'2025-01-18 17:01:32','2026-01-15 17:35:44'),(31,'Compare','yith-compare','<!-- wp:shortcode -->[yith_woocompare_table]<!-- /wp:shortcode -->',NULL,NULL,NULL,N